</chart><shape type="text" topLeftX="616" topLeftY="120" width="280" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(217,150,46)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="1" bold="true"><p>EXP_02 · 14 段典型样本同题对打</p></content></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="616" topLeftY="142" width="4" height="48"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(192,80,77)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="630" topLeftY="140" width="272" height="18"><content textType="body" fontSize="12.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>Bandit</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="630" topLeftY="160" width="272" height="34"><content textType="body" fontSize="10.5" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>召回 83.3% 但误报率 50%：把一半安全代码判成漏洞，关键案例与 Semgrep 双漏</p></content></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="616" topLeftY="204" width="4" height="48"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(74,127,165)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="630" topLeftY="202" width="272" height="18"><content textType="body" fontSize="12.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>Semgrep</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="630" topLeftY="222" width="272" height="34"><content textType="body" fontSize="10.5" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>误报为 0 但召回仅 75.0%：规则覆盖不到的写法一律看不见</p></content></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="616" topLeftY="266" width="4" height="48"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(111,163,155)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="630" topLeftY="264" width="272" height="18"><content textType="body" fontSize="12.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>纯 LLM</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="630" topLeftY="284" width="272" height="34"><content textType="body" fontSize="10.5" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>14 段小样本满分 ≠ 真实可用，需要更大、更真实的测试面</p></content></shape><line startX="616" startY="328" endX="896" endY="328"><border color="rgb(220,224,228)" width="1"/></line><shape type="text" topLeftX="616" topLeftY="338" width="280" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>放大到 87 段合成集 + 20 段真实 CVE</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="616" topLeftY="360" width="282" height="74"><content textType="body" fontSize="14" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top">['<p><span color="rgb(52,94,128)" bold="true" fontSize="11">纯 LLM 合成集误报 15.4%</span><span color="rgb(43,47,54)" fontSize="11">；真实 CVE-fix 召回仅 0.375</span></p>', '<p><span color="rgb(192,80,77)" bold="true" fontSize="11">合成集相对真实集虚高 59.2pp</span><span color="rgb(91,103,112)" fontSize="10.5">，单一测试集会自我误导</span></p>']</content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="452" width="852" height="40" presetHandlers="6"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(232,240,246)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="72" topLeftY="462" width="820" height="22"><content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgb(52,94,128)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="middle" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>结论：规则工具“看不全 / 喊得多”，纯 LLM“合成集好看、真实代码现形”——工具找全、LLM 判准的分工是唯一解</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="498" width="852" height="14"><content textType="body" fontSize="9" color="rgb(148,158,166)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>口径：exp_02 为 14 段典型样本同题对打；87 段合成集为 fixed5 干净评估；20 段真实 CVE-fix anchor；2026-09-03 冻结，score_batch 可复现</p></content></shape></data><note><content textType="body" fontSize="12"><p>这张图全部来自我们自建测试面的同题对打，口径是 2026 年 9 月冻结的最新版本。在 14 段典型样本上，Bandit 召回 83.3% 但误报率高达 50%，Semgrep 零误报但召回只有 75%，纯大模型看似满分。但把测试面放大到 87 段合成集，纯 LLM 误报率 15.4%；换到 20 段真实 CVE-fix，召回只有 0.375，合成集虚高 59.2 个百分点。任何单一路线都不达标，分工架构是被数据逼出来的选择。</p></content></note></slide>